{
  "key": 17426,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "Falkner: Out of all the Trainers\n",
        "out there, the best Trainer would\f",
        "have to be my dad.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "Janine: Ha!\n",
        "You don’t know a thing!\r",
        "The best Trainer in the world is Koga,\n",
        "one of the Elite Four!\f",
        "Namely--my dad!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "Falkner: You are mistaken.\n",
        "My dad treats Poké...\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Janine: Please stop this!\n",
        "Why don’t you just admit that my dad\f",
        "is the true Trainer!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Falkner: You were listening, right?\n",
        "You agree my dad is\f",
        "greater, right? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Falkner: You do?\n",
        "Just as I thought!\r",
        "You know something?\n",
        "I’m sure we’ll enjoy talking about\f",
        "my dad!\f",
        "Here is my number!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} registered Falkner\n",
        "in the Pokégear!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Falkner: Give me a call on Saturday\n",
        "morning if you want to hear about\f",
        "my dad!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Falkner: You don’t?\n",
        "I thought you were smarter than that.\r",
        "Oh, well.\f",
        "You’ll change your mind eventually."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Falkner: So, you did change your mind.\n",
        "You now think my dad\f",
        "is greater? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Falkner: Hey, why don’t we take\n",
        "a picture together? {YESNO 0}"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Falkner: All right!\n",
        "Are you ready?\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "Falkner: Yes!\n",
        "We look good."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "Falkner: That’s all right.\n",
        "I’ll just take one with my dad..."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "Your Photo Album is full.\r",
        "Access your PC and delete\n",
        "some pictures."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00015",
      "en_US": "Janine: Bah!"
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00016",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m here to buy Bloom Mail to send\n",
        "to my girlfriend."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00017",
      "en_US": [
        "You know what?\r",
        "Tunnel Mail is finally available\n",
        "at this department store!\r",
        "Previously, it was only sold\n",
        "in Violet City."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "msg_0497_T07R0104_00018",
      "en_US": [
        "Gifts to Express Yourself!\n",
        "4F: Wiseman Gifts"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
